  "description": "Experience the freedom a Brompton folding bike brings you, as you move in and around the city. And if you need to get away, just pop your Brompton on a plane, train, or in the car and create your adventure. Thanks to its compact size, the Brompton fold-up is welcomed at most places and venues.\n\nThe Brompton S2L in Black features an S-type handlebar; this is great for a lower, more forward and sportier position which feels more responsive. It holds a 2-speed gear for flat terrain and city riding, keeping it simple, as well as an important back-up lower gear for occasional hills. This model includes mudguards, a perfect option if you live in a region that rains.",
